# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# `tools/xtouch-probe` is deliberately not a workspace member (it opens a MIDI
# port, which ARCHITECTURE_SPEC.md 10.1 allows prism-surface no part of), so it
# has a build directory of its own that the root /target/ rule does not cover.
# Its Cargo.lock *is* committed: it is a binary, and a bring-up tool that builds
# differently next year is a measurement nobody can reproduce.
tools/*/target/

# Node / UI
node_modules/
ui/dist/
ui/.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Tauri
crates/prism-app/gen/
crates/prism-app/target/

# Generated bindings (regenerated from prism-domain)
ui/src/bindings/

# Show files and runtime data
*.prism
*.prism-shm
*.prism-wal
*.prism.backup
/recovery/

# ...except the frozen file S15's migration test reads. It is a version-1
# `.prism` file, written once and never again: a migration checked against a
# file the current code has just produced is a migration checked against itself.
!crates/prism-core/tests/fixtures/*.prism

# ...and the 64-universe rig S24's end-to-end suite starts a daemon on. The
# frame budget is measured against 64 *real* universes at 30 Hz, and the only
# way to have those in a browser is a show that patches them. Written by
# `cargo test -p prismd --test ui_telemetry -- --ignored` and opened by a test
# on every commit, so a format change fails in Rust rather than in Chromium.
!ui/tests/fixtures/*.prism

# Coverage and profiling
/coverage/
*.profraw
tarpaulin-report.*

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Playwright
ui/test-results/
# And one at the root, for a Playwright run started from the wrong directory.
/test-results/
ui/playwright-report/
ui/coverage/
ui/blob-report/
ui/.playwright/

# The Open Fixture Library, which is **downloaded at install time and not
# committed** (S44). `tools/fetch-fixtures` puts it here; `profiles/fixtures/SOURCE.md`
# says how and which revision. Vendoring 8.5 MB of data that has an upstream and
# a release cadence would make this repository the second copy of it, and the
# one that is out of date.
/profiles/fixtures/*
!/profiles/fixtures/SOURCE.md
